		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">2-channel electronic circuit breaker, 24 V DC, 2 x 1-10 A</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">one status LED, one push button and one current selector per channel; group alarm output; modular system (power module + channel modules) drawn as one assembly; module layout and LEDs assumed</elementInformation>
